Silvanna can control back-row enemies with her [ULTIMATE]
and then stun them with her [1st Skill].
Finally, she can deal damage with her [2nd Skill] and Basic Attacks.</p></div></div></section></div></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2 items-start mb-4 md:mb-6"><div class="hero-overview relative lg:pl-4 lg:border-l lg:border-[#C8AA6E]/30"><span class="hidden lg:block absolute left-0 top-0 w-1 h-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F0D060] via-[#C8AA6E] to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-[15px]">Silvanna is a pick tool disguised as an EXP fighter. She wins when the draft gives her one high-value body to isolate and a second teammate close enough to punish the cage. She feels awful when you ask her to blind-frontline into peel, cleanse, or repeated displacement.</p></div><section class="dossier-card relative bg-surface-2/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-border-default overflow-hidden" style="box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -22px rgba(0,0,0,0.85)" aria-label="Hero at-a-glance stats and attributes"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-mlbb-gold/0 via-mlbb-gold-bright/60 to-mlbb-gold/0" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold-bright/55" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-mlbb-gold-bright/55" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative p-4 md:p-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 bg-mlbb-green/10 border border-mlbb-green/40" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-activity w-3 h-3 text-mlbb-green" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2"></path></svg></span><p class="text-[11px] font-heading font-bold text-text-accent uppercase tracking-[0.32em]">At a Glance</p></div><div class="grid gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-x-8 sm:gap-y-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[10px] md:text-[11px] text-text-muted font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.14em] w-[72px] md:w-20 flex-shrink-0 font-semibold">Durability</span><div class="relative flex-1 h-2.5 overflow-hidden" style="background:#060913;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,170,110,0.12), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)"><div class="h-full relative" style="width:50%;background:linear-gradient(90deg, #3498DB80 0%, #3498DB 55%, #3498DB 100%);box-shadow:0 0 8px #3498DBaa, inset 0 0 8px #3498DB40"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.22) 50%, transparent 60%);mix-blend-mode:overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0, transparent calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 10%)" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><span class="text-[12px] md:text-[13px] font-heading font-bold tabular-nums w-6 text-right leading-none" style="color:#3498DB;text-shadow:0 0 8px #3498DB50">50</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[10px] md:text-[11px] text-text-muted font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.14em] w-[72px] md:w-20 flex-shrink-0 font-semibold">Offense</span><div class="relative flex-1 h-2.5 overflow-hidden" style="background:#060913;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,170,110,0.12), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)"><div class="h-full relative" style="width:40%;background:linear-gradient(90deg, #E74C3C80 0%, #E74C3C 55%, #E74C3C 100%);box-shadow:0 0 8px #E74C3Caa, inset 0 0 8px #E74C3C40"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.22) 50%, transparent 60%);mix-blend-mode:overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0, transparent calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 10%)" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><span class="text-[12px] md:text-[13px] font-heading font-bold tabular-nums w-6 text-right leading-none" style="color:#E74C3C;text-shadow:0 0 8px #E74C3C50">40</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[10px] md:text-[11px] text-text-muted font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.14em] w-[72px] md:w-20 flex-shrink-0 font-semibold">Control</span><div class="relative flex-1 h-2.5 overflow-hidden" style="background:#060913;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,170,110,0.12), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)"><div class="h-full relative" style="width:70%;background:linear-gradient(90deg, #F0D06080 0%, #F0D060 55%, #F0D060 100%);box-shadow:0 0 8px #F0D060aa, inset 0 0 8px #F0D06040"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.22) 50%, transparent 60%);mix-blend-mode:overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0, transparent calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 10%)" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><span class="text-[12px] md:text-[13px] font-heading font-bold tabular-nums w-6 text-right leading-none" style="color:#F0D060;text-shadow:0 0 8px #F0D06050">70</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[10px] md:text-[11px] text-text-muted font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.14em] w-[72px] md:w-20 flex-shrink-0 font-semibold">Difficulty</span><div class="relative flex-1 h-2.5 overflow-hidden" style="background:#060913;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,170,110,0.12), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)"><div class="h-full relative" style="width:30%;background:linear-gradient(90deg, #9B59B680 0%, #9B59B6 55%, #9B59B6 100%);box-shadow:0 0 8px #9B59B6aa, inset 0 0 8px #9B59B640"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.22) 50%, transparent 60%);mix-blend-mode:overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0, transparent calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 10%)" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><span class="text-[12px] md:text-[13px] font-heading font-bold tabular-nums w-6 text-right leading-none" style="color:#9B59B6;text-shadow:0 0 8px #9B59B650">30</span></div></div><a class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors" href="/tier-list">See Silvanna in full tier list<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></section></div><div id="ad-4865714798" class="my-6" style="width:100%"><style>#ad-4865714798{min-height:280px}@media(min-width:768px){#ad-4865714798{min-height:280px}}</style><p class="text-[10px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#9BA0B4]/40 text-center mb-2">Advertisement</p><ins class="adsbygoogle" style="display:block" data-ad-client="ca-pub-3465999061396690" data-ad-slot="4865714798" data-ad-format="auto" data-full-width-responsive="true"></ins></div><div class="relative content-lazy lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_clamp(230px,24%,300px)] lg:gap-x-6 xl:gap-x-8 lg:items-start"><div class="lg:order-2 lg:sticky lg:self-start" style="top:128px"></div><section id="hero-article" class="relative lg:order-1 bg-[#0a0a0a]/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#C8AA6E]/15 p-5 md:p-9 overflow-hidden" style="box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -24px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#F0D060]/55 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-[#F0D060]/40" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-[#C8AA6E]/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute -top-32 -right-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-[#C8AA6E]/[0.05] blur-3xl pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative hero-article-body max-w-[860px] mx-auto"><h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Pick her for the cage, not the lane</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Silvanna is not a comfort blind. She is a reaction pick whose value spikes when the enemy draft depends on one mobile damage dealer playing one step too far forward. If the opposing win condition is a Ling, Fanny, Pharsa, Clint, or any backliner that survives by leaving the fight on demand, Silvanna turns that escape pattern into a death sentence.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Lock her when three conditions line up. First, the enemy has a carry you can identify before loading screen, not just &quot;someone squishy.&quot; Second, your team has instant follow-up from mid or roam so the trapped target dies before help arrives. Third, the enemy lineup is light on displacement, cleanse, and suppress. Silvanna does not need a perfect lane. She needs one clean cage that turns a 5v5 into a 5v4.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Bench her when the enemy already shows the tools that make Imperial Justice look fake. Valir can push her out of her own work. Akai can spin her off the trapped target. Franco and Kaja punish the dive before it cashes in. Ruby drags fights sideways and forces Silvanna to hit the wrong body. Double Purify drafts are another red flag, because a hero built around one hard commit should not be gambling into two free exits.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">EXP lane is still her most reliable home because the extra levels matter more than the extra gold. Jungle Silvanna exists, but it is a situational answer when your team needs hard catch from the core slot. If the lobby does not give you a clear target and a clear follow-up path, pick a real frontliner instead.</p>
<h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Silvanna is a private duel inside a public fight</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Silvanna is not a general-purpose initiator. She is a private duel inside a public fight.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Everything in her kit points toward one idea: trap one hero, stay glued to that hero, and let repeated hits make the later part of the trade stronger than the first. Her passive rewards staying on target. Her first skill is not there to start every engage on sight; it is there to make sure the target cannot walk away once the fight has started. Her second skill is the actual verdict. The spin keeps pulling, keeps hitting, keeps stacking pressure, and forces the target to either leave immediately or die where they stand.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">That is why Silvanna feels unfair in the right draft and toothless in the wrong one. When the enemy cannot displace her and cannot cleanse the catch, every repeated hit becomes a countdown. When they can break the cage or drag her off the target, the whole hero collapses into a melee body with mediocre waveclear and no second plan.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Play her like a specialist. She does not want to &quot;start the fight.&quot; She wants to decide who is not allowed to play it.</p>
<h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Laning: the first 5 minutes</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Silvanna&#x27;s first job in lane is not winning every trade. It is arriving at the first Turtle with health, level lead, and one spell still worth respecting.</p>
<ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-[#9BA0B4] my-3 space-y-2 ml-2">
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Take Spiral Strangling first and angle it through both hero and wave.</strong> The skill deals reduced damage to minions, so a pure waveclear cast is a bad trade. Stand off-center, clip the opposing EXP laner with the outer path, and make the lane shove only when it also taxes their HP bar.</li>
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Treat Cometic Lance as the answer, not the question.</strong> Hold it until the enemy burns a dash, steps up for the cannon minion, or commits into your side of the lane. Missing the first hit removes your stick tool and your escape in the same breath.</li>
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Spend Vengeance only on real all-ins or the first objective fight.</strong> Press it after Imperial Justice lands and your spin has already started. If you use it on a half trade at minute 2, the minute 3 rotation becomes harmless and the enemy gets to contest Turtle without respecting you.</li>
</ol>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">If you are even on lane by minute 4, that is fine. Silvanna is not farming for an endless side-lane. She is farming for one forced fight around river where a trapped jungler or mid laner decides the objective.</p>
<h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>The power spike you are farming toward</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Silvanna&#x27;s real two-item spike is Genius Wand plus Concentrated Energy, usually around minute 8 to 10 after boots.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Genius Wand is the first half of the trick. Its passive strips magic defense every time you keep damage flowing, which is exactly what Silvanna does once Spiral Strangling starts ticking. The target enters the trade with one amount of magic defense and finishes the trade with far less, which means the later hits matter more than the early ones.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Concentrated Energy is the second half. Silvanna has no trouble stacking Recharge because her damage arrives in repeated hits, not one burst packet. That means the item reaches its extra Magic Power and then its short magic-damage boost inside the same committed fight where she already wants to stand on top of someone. The bonus HP matters too, because Silvanna does not need another glass-cannon slot at this timing. She needs enough life to stay in the cage for the full spin.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Before this pair, Silvanna threatens but still needs help finishing. After this pair, she starts killing cleanly off one caught carry or deleting half of an objective fight by removing the enemy jungler on entry. That is the window where you stop asking whether you can force and start asking which target is worth the spell cycle.</p><div id="ad-7246933188" class="my-8" style="width:100%"><style>#ad-7246933188{min-height:280px}@media(min-width:768px){#ad-7246933188{min-height:320px}}</style><p class="text-[10px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#9BA0B4]/40 text-center mb-2">Advertisement</p><ins class="adsbygoogle" style="display:block;text-align:center" data-ad-client="ca-pub-3465999061396690" data-ad-slot="7246933188" data-ad-format="fluid" data-ad-layout="in-article"></ins></div><h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Teamfight positioning and target priority</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">The common bad reflex is ulting the first body that crosses vision. Silvanna is not paid by crowd control duration. She is paid by clean kills on the right target.</p>
<ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-[#9BA0B4] my-3 space-y-2 ml-2">
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Wait for one peel button to disappear.</strong> If Valir still has knockback, Akai still has Heavy Spin, or Franco is still holding hook plus suppress, your engage is not ready yet. Let your tank or mage pull one answer first, then dive.</li>
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Place Imperial Justice on the exit path, not the center of the model.</strong> Cast slightly behind a retreating target so the closest trapped hero is the one trying to leave, not the frontliner stepping in front.</li>
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Spin through one target, then reset your feet.</strong> Once the pick is secured, do not stand in place autoing whoever is nearby just because the circle is still up. Reposition with the second cast of Cometic Lance if it is available, or step out and look for the next angle.</li>
</ol>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">The support-dependent edge case matters. If Angela, Mathilda, or Floryn is already connected to your dive, you can jump deeper and trust the sustain to finish the commit. Without that support layer, only dive targets your mid laner can reach immediately. Silvanna looks brave when she enters alone. She also dies alone.</p>
<h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Itemization: defaults vs flex slots</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Default boots are Tough Boots. Default damage spine is Genius Wand plus Concentrated Energy. After that, the build should answer the lobby, not a screenshot from an old guide.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Boot choice is the first conversation. Stay on Tough Boots as the ranked default, because the control-duration reduction is what keeps Silvanna attached to a target that keeps trying to shake the cage. Swap to Arcane Boots when the enemy EXP lane is light on early crowd control and the first cage needs extra Magic Penetration to finish the trapped target. Swap to Warrior Boots when the EXP matchup is basic-attack heavy and you need to survive lane long enough to reach your first spike.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">The flex slots should be real decisions:</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[#9BA0B4] my-3 space-y-2 ml-2">
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]">Take <strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Glowing Wand</strong> into HP stackers, regen comps, or shield-heavy drafts. Scorch adds percent-HP pressure and Lifebane stops sustain heroes from outliving your full combo.</li>
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]">Take <strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Brute Force Breastplate</strong> when fights are long and messy. Silvanna damages constantly, so Brute Force stacks naturally and gives the movement speed and control-duration reduction she needs to keep contact after the jump.</li>
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]">Take <strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Oracle</strong> when the enemy is trying to wear you down instead of deleting you in one spell cycle. Bless increases received shield and HP regen by 25%, which makes Spiral Strangling&#x27;s shield far more difficult to chew through.</li>
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]">Take <strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Winter Crown</strong> when your job is diving one carry, forcing cooldowns, and living through the collapse. Start the spin first, then freeze when the counterburst arrives.</li>
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]">Take <strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Divine Glaive</strong> the moment Athena&#x27;s Shield, Radiant-style anti-magic buys, or stacked magic defense starts showing up. Silvanna hates half-winning a catch because the target finally bought enough resistance to walk away.</li>
</ul>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">If the draft already has enough damage and only needs you to force one more round of spells, finish with Immortality over greed. Silvanna does not need six damage items to matter. She needs enough damage to make the cage lethal and enough durability to survive being seen.</p>
<h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Mistakes that lose Silvanna games</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Blind-picking her into repeated displacement.</strong> Silvanna can punish mobility, but she hates being moved herself. Valir, Akai, Ruby, Franco, and Kaja all change the fight by denying her contact with the trapped target. If two of those tools are already visible, stop trying to outplay draft phase.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Throwing Cometic Lance before the target spends mobility.</strong> This is the mechanical mistake that ruins more Silvanna fights than bad itemization. If you open with S1 into a ready dash or Purify, you have spent your stick tool and your exit path together. Walk first, threaten the ult, and force the response before you lance.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Hard-spinning every wave and arriving late to river.</strong> Silvanna&#x27;s second skill is not good enough on minions to justify burning it mindlessly. When you use your whole lane pattern just to clear, the enemy EXP gets first move to Turtle and your strongest early objective window disappears.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Ulting the tank because he is nearest.</strong> A trapped frontliner is not automatically a good target. Ask whether killing that hero changes the next five seconds. If the answer is no and the enemy carry is still untouched, you used your best cooldown for noise instead of value.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Building only damage when your job is first entry.</strong> One penetration item and one sustain item are enough for Silvanna to threaten squishies. After that, ranked games are usually decided by whether she survives the counterturn. Skip every defensive slot and the hero stops being a pick tool and becomes free shutdown gold.</p>
<h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Key tips</h2>
<div class="my-5 p-4 flex gap-3" style="background:rgba(200,170,110,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#C8AA6E"><path d="M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5"></path><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 22h4"></path></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color:#C8AA6E">Tip</p><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Cast Imperial Justice slightly behind a retreating carry. The restraint checks the closest hero inside the circle, so back-edge placement catches the runner instead of the bodyguard stepping forward.</p></div></div>
<div class="my-5 p-4 flex gap-3" style="background:rgba(200,170,110,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#C8AA6E"><path d="M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5"></path><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 22h4"></path></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color:#C8AA6E">Tip</p><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Genius Wand stacks during Spiral Strangling. The first part of the spin is setup. The back half is where the target starts paying for staying inside the cage.</p></div></div>
<div class="my-5 p-4 flex gap-3" style="background:rgba(0,170,255,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#00AAFF"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color:#00AAFF">Note</p><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Oracle is not a generic tank buy on Silvanna. Buy it for long trades, because Bless increases her received shield by 25% and turns Spiral Strangling into a much harder commitment to break.</p></div></div>
<div class="my-5 p-4 flex gap-3" style="background:rgba(200,170,110,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#C8AA6E"><path d="M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5"></path><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 22h4"></path></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color:#C8AA6E">Tip</p><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Winter Crown can be pressed after Spiral Strangling starts. Frozen stops new casts, but it does not interrupt a skill that is already running, which lets Silvanna keep spinning while dodging the counterburst.</p></div></div><aside class="not-prose mt-10 border border-mlbb-gold/25 bg-mlbb-bg-accent/30 p-5 sm:p-6" aria-label="About the author of this Silvanna guide"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-5"><a class="shrink-0" aria-label="About Slendertaker" href="/authors/slendertaker"><img alt="Slendertaker" loading="lazy" width="72" height="72" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-[72px] w-[72px] rounded-full border border-mlbb-gold/50 object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/authors/slendertaker.webp"/></a><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-mlbb-text-secondary">Written by</div><a class="font-heading text-lg text-mlbb-gold hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" rel="author" href="/authors/slendertaker">Slendertaker</a><div class="text-sm text-mlbb-text-secondary">Mythic Immortal, Founder &amp; Editor of MLBBHub</div><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text">Slendertaker climbed to Mythic Immortal in Mobile Legends, the apex of the ranked ladder, before sitting down to build the tool he wished existed while he was getting there. MLBBHub is that tool. He writes every hero guide on the site personally, picks the curated builds, and owns the data pipeline that keeps patch notes, items, and emblems in sync.</p><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a href="https://github.com/slendertaker" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer me" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-gold/30 bg-mlbb-bg-accent/40 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-mlbb-text-secondary transition hover:border-mlbb-gold hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" aria-label="GitHub profile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-github" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"></path><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"></path></svg><span>GitHub</span></a><a href="https://x.com/slendertaker7" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer me" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-gold/30 bg-mlbb-bg-accent/40 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-mlbb-text-secondary transition hover:border-mlbb-gold hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" aria-label="X profile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-twitter" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z"></path></svg><span>X</span></a><a href="https://slendertaker.com" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer me" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-gold/30 bg-mlbb-bg-accent/40 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-mlbb-text-secondary transition hover:border-mlbb-gold hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" aria-label="slendertaker.com profile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg><span>slendertaker.com</span></a></div></div></div></aside></div></section></div></div><div id="tabpanel-skills" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-skills" hidden=""></div><div id="tabpanel-matchups" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-matchups" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="space-y-6 lg:space-y-8"><div class="glass-card border-mlbb-gold/15 p-4 sm:p-5" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(-8px)"><div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-4 lg:grid-cols-[auto_auto_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] lg:gap-x-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 bg-mlbb-red/10 border border-mlbb-red/30 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-5 h-5 text-mlbb-red" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-xs font-heading font-bold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Top Counter</p><p class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-1.5 text-sm text-text-accent-bright font-heading font-bold"><span class="min-w-0 truncate">Barats</span><span class="shrink-0 text-mlbb-green text-xs">+<!-- -->3.4<!-- --> pp</span></p></div><a aria-label="Open full counter page for Silvanna" class="group inline-flex h-8 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-gold/20 bg-surface-2/45 px-2.5 font-heading text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-text-accent transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold-bright/45 hover:text-text-accent-bright lg:col-start-4 lg:row-start-1" href="/counter/silvanna"><span>View all</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><div class="col-span-3 grid gap-2 text-center grid-cols-3 sm:flex sm:items-center sm:justify-around lg:col-span-1 lg:col-start-3 lg:row-start-1"><div><p class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-mlbb-green">17</p><p class="text-[9px] text-text-muted uppercase tracking-wider">Counters</p></div><div><p class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-text-accent">5</p><p class="text-[9px] text-text-muted uppercase tracking-wider">Weak To</p></div><div><p class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-text-accent-bright truncate">Late</p><p class="text-[9px] text-text-muted uppercase tracking-wider">Peak Phase</p></div></div></div></div><div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start lg:gap-6"><section><div class="mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-5 h-5 text-mlbb-green" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg><h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-heading font-bold text-text-primary">How to Counter<!-- --> <span style="color:#ff4444">Silvanna</span></h2></div><p class="text-xs text-text-muted max-w-2xl">These heroes have the biggest measured edge against Silvanna in ranked matches. Pick any of them for a statistical advantage in draft.</p></div><div class="space-y-3"><div class="group relative bg-surface-3 border border-mlbb-gold/15 hover:border-mlbb-green/30 transition-all duration-300" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 sm:gap-4 sm:p-4"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-7 sm:w-8 text-center"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-heading font-bold text-text-accent">#<!-- -->1</span></div><a class="flex-shrink-0" href="/heroes/barats"><div class="relative overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="width:48px;height:48px;min-width:48px;background-color:#3498DB12"><img alt="Barats hero icon" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_6495be044c2d28106e200f6918391d54.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_6495be044c2d28106e200f6918391d54.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_6495be044c2d28106e200f6918391d54.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></a><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 flex-wrap"><a class="min-w-0 max-w-full truncate font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-text-primary hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors" href="/heroes/barats">Barats</a><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-heading font-bold bg-gradient-to-br from-[#C8AA6E] to-[#A08040] text-[#14110b] shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(200,170,110,0.3)] w-6 h-6 text-xs animate-tier-pop">A</div><div class="gap-1.5 hidden sm:flex"><span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5" style="background-color:#3498DB20;color:#71b7e6">Tank</span><span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5" style="background-color:#FF8C0020;color:#ffaf4d">Fighter</span></div></div><p class="text-xs text-text-muted mt-1 line-clamp-2">Across Silvanna&#x27;s measured matchups, Silvanna is weakest in the early game. Apply pressure with Barats before Silvanna can scale.</p></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 text-right"><p class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-lg sm:text-xl font-heading font-bold" style="color:#44ff88"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg>+<!-- -->3.4</p><p class="text-[9px] text-text-muted uppercase hidden sm:block">win rate delta</p></div></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold/20 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/20 pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="group relative bg-surface-3 border border-mlbb-gold/15 hover:border-mlbb-green/30 transition-all duration-300" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 sm:gap-4 sm:p-4"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-7 sm:w-8 text-center"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-heading font-bold text-text-accent">#<!-- -->2</span></div><a class="flex-shrink-0" href="/heroes/benedetta"><div class="relative overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="width:48px;height:48px;min-width:48px;background-color:#0